The steamy launderette part 0 is some text that varies. The steamy launderette part 0 is "You've just shown up in a steamy launderette. Okay, just remember what you're here to do, and everything will go great.



You need an unguarded exit? You should try going south.".
The description of r_99 is "[steamy launderette part 0]".

The r_36 is mapped south of r_99.

The o_0 are object-likes.
The o_0 are privately-named.
